{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "70af581d7c46748de56782a2cbcefd6f6b326c9d6f5b57b66be8abcd869e03ae", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画で、杏奈がゲームのCMに出演\nする。主人公の猫に扮して撮影する杏奈だが……）", "zh": "（在角色扮演写真企划中，杏奈将出演游戏广告。\n扮演主角的猫进行拍摄的杏奈，却……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "7d02be811a5753297e895b4f0a689afbfe2b2e9d428823e51548f51fb4394ca4", "ja": "動物の動きも、難しいけど……操作されてるみたいに、\n動くのも……すごく難しい、ね……。", "zh": "动物的动作也很难……要像被操控一样活动……也非常难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "84a1a4cc211c07e609c425b08c170fa40bbe500030a5d3397d7c783f179a848a", "ja": "杏奈、このゲーム、たくさんプレイしたし……\nネコカフェで、ネコも観察した……。", "zh": "杏奈玩过很多次这个游戏……还在猫咖观察过猫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdef4c1df7a2666ed629f339242867c4faea1ceb3f4dfada32329a95d489a5f0", "ja": "だけど……ぜんぜん、思い通りに動けない……。\nなんか、悔しい……。", "zh": "但是……完全没法按自己的想法行动……总觉得……好不甘心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a035e5773cb18de24823ce017d063554394eba9452bfe6eeb3d969b5b189adc6", "ja": "？　見てる分にはわからなかったけど……\nどこが違ったのか、聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "？光看着的话没发现……能问问具体是哪里不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "11f251561d664236c679d1fab40647fd1efddcb0b39cd98fc485ab3d2a64f2fd", "ja": "えっとね、ゲームだと……スッ、スッって動くけど\n……杏奈は、スルーッって感じ……。", "zh": "那个，在游戏里是……唰、唰地动，\n……但杏奈的话，是唰——地滑过去……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "684c7d9b7154c64f8b88cac4376e4c9a7719321d75814b4ccfc4a9122f48db2d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、伝わった……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，听懂我的意思了么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ad404b0d35c34cbbebdd455af5e297d3f835a0b5850af30ef4a8cae54f6ceca0", "ja": "……なんとなく？　とにかく、\n動物のネコより、ゲームの方に近づけたいんだな？", "zh": "……算是吧？总之，\n比起动物的猫咪，你更想贴近游戏里的形象对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "bea2df332b3d324cdf6f09e7c55c4ce8345347dd3176047f7888c80b83826090", "ja": "うん……。CMで、初めて見る人に……\nこのゲームの良さ、いっぱい伝えたいから……。", "zh": "嗯……。因为我想通过广告，向第一次接触的人……\n多多传达出这款游戏的优点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e7d1551e971b8798de555194910b52d4364cb4c0a8bd559424274e5d64e0a953", "ja": "そうか……。じゃあ、動物のことは一旦忘れて、\nゲームの主人公の動きに集中してみようか。", "zh": "这样啊……那就先暂时忘掉动物的事，试着把注意力集中在游戏主角的动作上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "23e2b11aca47f15d6e27468581f6f6391b168a2ba9a47cca1aeba9511fcf7f48", "ja": "……あ。ゲームのネコは……現実と、\nちょっと動きが違うもんね……。そっか……集中……。", "zh": "……啊。游戏里的猫……和现实中的动作，稍微有点不一样呢……。这样啊……集中……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "012466600947756d4a268d7d4f7e87ca2ad58480302a5dc0802837458a4d4477", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈……次は、もっとうまく、できるかも……♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生……。\n杏奈……下次说不定能做得更好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
