{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0533_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "86754126af93af84dc3118e5315b97836a14739f1660cc13e60067714404c25c", "ja": "にゃにゃん♪　路地裏、屋根の上、公園……\n杏奈と一緒に、いろんな場所を冒険しようよっ！", "zh": "喵喵♪ 一起和杏奈去小巷、屋顶、公园……各种地方冒险吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
